  "notes": "501(c)(3) no-kill since 1998 (founder Bobbi Giordano); dogs + cats, including special-needs. Queens WALK-IN shelter at 80-36 Cooper Ave, Glendale 11385, (718) 326-6070 (Mon-Fri 11-5, Sat 11-4:30, Sun 11-4). Adoption requires application + home visit + approval; will take an animal back if an adoption fails. Also runs community programs for low-income/elderly/disabled owners. NOTE: also has a separate LONG ISLAND (Freeport) location at 2 Rider Pl 11520, (516) 378-4340 - the Glendale site is the NYC one. Email: (via site contact form)",
